  "instance_name": "mapping_3",
  "label": "The speaker is mapped onto the workshop scene",
  "description": "The text 'than i do with a 4 year degree' is followed by the statistic about jobs not requiring a degree, which is then visually reinforced by the workshop scene. The workshop scene, featuring a man in manual labor, is used to represent the alternative path (vocational education) that the speaker implies is more practical. The speaker is implicitly mapped onto this scene as the visual representation of a more viable or successful alternative to a 4-year degree.",
